{"id":"n29761-12-17","stage":1,"title":"풀다 · 化开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29761-12-17-1","ko":"내가 끓인 국 맛이 어때?","zh":"我煮的汤味道怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"끓인","meaning":"煮，烧","explanation":"끓이다：煮，烧；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"끓이다","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59474","senseId":"2","lemma":"끓이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끓인","audio":"/audio/84976e0a96a853ae4ba2.mp3"}},{"text":"국","meaning":"汤","explanation":"국：汤。","readings":[{"term":"국","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36778","senseId":"1","lemma":"국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3"}},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛이","audio":"/audio/967e9ccf650ca1244186.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e0e928624bcebfda","term":"끓이다","zh":"煮，烧"